@startuml

salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - REPORTING: SIGN OFF A PRICING ENGINE CHANGE</b>
  Home > Reporting > Pricing engines > Sign-off
  --
  <b>THE QUEUE</b>
  "Search the configuration and the change" | ^Show: open^
  {#
    Configuration | Cycle | Change | Proposed by | Sign-off | State | For you
    End of day pricing | End of day | v4 to v5 | market risk owner | Quant 1 of 3 | Awaiting sign-off | Needs your sign-off
    Intraday pricing | Intraday | v2 to v3 | market risk owner | 0 of 3 | Awaiting sign-off | -
  }
  --
  <b>ONE PROPOSAL: END OF DAY PRICING, VERSION 5</b>
  Awaiting sign-off - End of day - version 4 is in force until this is approved
  [ Sign-off ] | [ Changes ] | [ Reach ] | [ History ]
  Four eyes: the person who proposes a change cannot sign it off.
  {#
    Role | Decision | Person | When | Comment
    Quant team | Approved | quant lead | 2 days ago | -
    Market risk | Waiting | - | - | [ Approve ] | [ Reject ]
    Model validation | Waiting | - | - | -
  }
  When all roles approve:
  [ Make version 5 official ]
  The proposer sees: You proposed this change. Another person in Market risk must sign it off.
}

@enduml
